      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span>Which platforms do you support?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a">We support all major e-commerce platforms including Shopify, Amazon, WooCommerce, BigCommerce, Magento, and any custom store with a public product URL. Our scraper works across 12+ marketplaces and we add new platform support every quarter based on user demand.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span>How often do you check competitor prices?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a">Free users get on-demand analysis — run as many checks as you need, whenever you need them. Premium users get real-time monitoring with price checks every 15 minutes on monitored products, plus instant Slack or email alerts within minutes of any competitor price change. Enterprise plans offer custom check frequencies down to 5-minute intervals.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span>Do I need technical knowledge to use Talon?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a">Not at all. Talon is designed for operators, not engineers. Simply paste a product URL, and our system handles the rest — scraping, analysis, and actionable recommendations delivered in seconds. No API keys, no setup, no coding required.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span>Is my data secure?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a">Absolutely. We don't store your product data — we only analyze it to generate insights. All data is encrypted in transit and at rest. We're SOC 2 Type II compliant and never share your competitive intelligence with third parties. Your pricing strategy stays private.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
